flowchart LR
 B[Browser / mobile] --> E[CDN-WAF-LB-Gateway]
 E --> C[Catalogue-Sale API]
 E --> A[Cart API]
 E --> X[Checkout API]
 E --> O[Order API-worker]
 X --> I[Inventory API-worker]
 X --> P[Payment API-worker]
 C --> D1[(Catalogue PostgreSQL)]
 C --> R[(Redis cache)]
 A --> D2[(Cart PostgreSQL)]
 I --> D3[(Inventory PostgreSQL)]
 P --> D4[(Payment PostgreSQL)]
 O --> D5[(Order PostgreSQL)]
 D3 -.-> K[Outbox relay and Kafka]
 D4 -.-> K
 D5 -.-> K
 K -.-> I
 K -.-> P
 K -.-> O
 K -.-> F[Fulfilment worker]
 K -.-> N[Notification worker]
 F --> D6[(Shipment PostgreSQL)]
 N --> D7[(Notification PostgreSQL)]
 P --> PG[Payment gateway external]
 F --> CA[Carrier external]
 N --> CP[Communication external]
